<title>USA: Callaway sees titanium golf club sales up.</title>
<headline>Callaway sees titanium golf club sales up.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Callaway Golf Co said Tuesday its sales of golf clubs with titanium heads will be up substantially in 1997, and sales of titanium clubs as a category will be significant.</p>
</text>
